[[22,127,4294967296,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagment circuit.</p><p>The relay is supplied by the line controlled\nby the ignition (INT/A) for relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              :\nboth are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil is supplied by the line from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2\nfor the additional fuse box B98 A for the main injection relay J10\ntherefore the relay is energized by an earth signal coming from\nthe engine management control unit M10: in this way the air conditioning\ncompressor L20 engagement electro-magnet is operated through a voltage\nof 12 V.</strong></p><p>Climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70 ( pin 11 of\nconnector A) sends a compressor enablement signal to four-stage\npressure switch K10. If circuit pressures are correct, the signal\nleaves the pressure switch and reaches engine control unit M10 -\npin 6 of connector A.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               According to its internal control logic,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends - from pin 13 of connector A -\nthe command to engage the compressor which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]